Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:01:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,《小鬼当家2：迷失纽约》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的高尔夫球呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are my golf balls?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.84,0:02:29.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁见到我的太阳油?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone seen my sun block?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.91,0:02:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去佛罗里达还搽什么太阳油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the point of going to Florida if you use sun block?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已准备晒得一身古铜色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care, I'm getting toasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好极了! 你一定可以晒成黑碳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Now you can be a skag with a darker shade of skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他不能晒太阳所以妒忌 他已经满脸都是雀斑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's jealous because he can't tan. His freckles just connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要喝那么多汽水 尿片都已收好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, easy on the fluids! The rubber sheets are packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:50.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,域琪 她说要"叮"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wants "Ding. "
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:53.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"叮"的后面是... 两百分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind "Ding" is 200 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:02:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二百分! 好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}200 points! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亲爱的 你准备好了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, are you packed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.46,0:03:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要我帮你放到外面吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything I put out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.89,0:03:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道这次旅行祖母送你什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, did you see what Grandma sent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.70,0:03:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我猜猜看 唐老鸭拖鞋?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess. Donald Duck slippers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.19,0:03:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,差不多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以在水里玩的充气小丑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inflatable clown to play with in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.63,0:03:27.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真令人兴奋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么去佛罗里达? 佛罗里达没有圣诞树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why Florida? There's no Christmas trees in Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.73,0:03:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞树那么重要吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it with Christmas trees?
