Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:41.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以用假树或椰树装饰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find a nice fake silver one. Or decorate a palm tree.
