Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,广场酒店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New York's most exciting hotel experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,订房致电 1800759...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For reservations, call toll-free, 1-800-759...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:04:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 摄录机的电池在哪里? - 在充电器里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the camcorder battery? - I put it in the charger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好看多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文 你最好快戴上领带 我们不想去圣诞晚会迟到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin, put your tie on. We'll be late for the Christmas pageant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的领带在浴室 我不能进去 因为法兰叔叔在洗澡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in the bathroom. I can't go in. Uncle Frank's taking a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说若我进去看见他的裸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says if I walk in there and see him naked,
