Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:42.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要看他赶快出来就可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...get out, and don't look at anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:51.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们说的那只猫不知道是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This cat they're talking about I wonder who, could it be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:57.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是最肥的一只猫 你从没见过这样肥的猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I know I'm the heaviest cat The heaviest cat you ever did see
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:05:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当他们看到我在街上走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they see me Walkin ' down the street
