Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:05.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各陪审团成员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen of the jury...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要为我的行为所引起的不快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'd like to apologize for whatever displeasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 向我的家人道歉 - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...I might have caused you. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的行为是不成熟且不适当的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My prank was immature and ill-timed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管是否不成熟 这恶作剧很有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Immature or not, it was pretty darn hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,同时我也要向弟弟道歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also apologize to my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.83,0:07:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:35.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,巴斯...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Buzz...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:45.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文 你有话要说吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin, do you have something to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你可以扮得更真诚吗? 死仔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beat that, you trout-sniffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不会道歉! 我那样做全是因为巴斯让我难堪...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sorry. I did it because Buzz humiliated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他可逃避一切责任 我无话可说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gets away with everything, so I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,既然你们笨到相信他的谎话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you stupidly believe his lies...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不理会是否破坏佛州之旅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I don't care if your Florida trip is wrecked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁要到热带过圣诞节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wants to spend Christmas in a tropical climate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.02,0:08:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若你这样的话 你便上三楼睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You walk out, you sleep on the 3rd floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 跟我睡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们还有新招吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what else is new?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你最好别破坏我的旅行 你爸付出了很多钱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't wreck my trip. Your dad's paying good money for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才不会破坏你的旅程 贪便宜到死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't want to spoil your fun, Mr. Cheapskate.
