Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:04.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你记得上次旅行的时候 一开始也是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time we tried to take a trip, we had a problem just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 都是针对我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, with me getting crapped on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管你怎么说 上次没针对你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care for your choice of words. That's not what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.17,0:09:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,何况巴斯已经向你道歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buzz apologized to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 他还叫我死仔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, then he called me a trout-sniffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.11,0:09:18.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他不是真心道歉 他只想欺骗你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't mean it. He was just sucking up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 你在这里好好想清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, why don't you just sit up here and think things over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你准备好道歉时 你就可以下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you're ready to apologize to everyone, you can come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不会向巴斯道歉 我宁愿去死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not apologizing to Buzz. I'd rather kiss a toilet seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你就在这里过夜!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then stay up here all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,反正我也不想下去! 全家没有一个人可信任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to go down anyway! I can't trust anybody in this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如我自己有钱 我会一个人去度假{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? If I had my own money, I'd go on my own vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,独自一人 不要有你们任何人 那我就自由自在开心快活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alone, without any of you. And I'd have the most fun of my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:50.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去年你的愿望实现了 也许今年又会应验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got your wish last year. Maybe you will this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:51.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,希望如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.07,0:10:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(芝加哥太阳时报 水喉大盗趁监狱骚动脱逃)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.70,0:10:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(机场快车)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.81,0:10:42.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们又睡过头! - 我们再次做到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We did it again! - We did it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.45,0:10:56.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们家坐第一辆 其余的坐第二辆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our McCallisters here, other McCallisters there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.35,0:11:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不该对免费旅行不满 但你们实在太晚叫人起床{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shouldn't complain, but you give the worst wake-up calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 机票在你那里吗? - 在我这儿 这是你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you have the tickets? - I've got them. Here's your family's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.29,0:11:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你有几张? - 七张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many do you have? - Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 七张! - 十四张!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have seven. - 14!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:17.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,七 八 九 十{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven...eight...nine, ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么全都是分开坐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come we're not sitting together?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:20.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这旺季可以搭同一班飞机 已经很好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time of year, we're lucky to get on the same plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,十一 十二 十三{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}11, 12, 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.87,0:11:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,十四{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我自己拿着机票比较好 免得你们又撇下我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good thing I have my own ticket, just in case you try to ditch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快点 - 我要电池{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - I need batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我袋里有电池 上机后给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give them to you on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.61,0:11:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 还有两件行李 - 为什么现在不能给我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here's two more. - Why not now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等吧 在几号闸口登机?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not now! What's the gate number?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:55.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是H-17{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}H-17.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最好走快点 登机闸口在最后的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better hurry, it's the last gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸 几号登机门?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, what gate is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:02.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,H-17 巴斯 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}H-17, Buzz. Come on, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:05.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文 你拿我的袋吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin, you gonna take my bag? Take my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:07.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美国航空公司飞往纽约的226号班机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}American Airlines flight 226 to New York...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.05,0:12:39.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即将起飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is now in the final boarding process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.23,0:12:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快呀 快呀!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.23,0:12:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸 等一等!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸 等等我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.97,0:13:00.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:10.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸 等等!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到了 就是这里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全部到齐? 我们赶到了? 好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody here? We made it? All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.11,0:13:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托 要登机了 飞机准备要起飞了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please board, the plane's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想确定大家都上了飞机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make sure everyone gets on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有人都会上飞机的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get everyone on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐 旅途愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas. Have a nice flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 再见! - 再见!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye. - Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:39.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 等一等!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.45,0:13:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 差点就赶不及了 - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cutting it kind of close. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:47.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas. Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸 等一等!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.06,0:13:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.69,0:13:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 对不起 - 没关系 你是搭这班机的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry. - That's okay. Are you on this flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.09,0:13:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 我全家都已经上了机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. My family's on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:13:59.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不想一人被留下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to be left here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.93,0:14:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你有登机证吗? - 就在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you have a boarding pass? - Somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.63,0:14:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准备起飞了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他掉了登机证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He dropped his pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.60,0:14:09.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去年我也是被留下 差点毁了我的圣诞节假期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This happened to me last year and almost wrecked my Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你肯定你家人在机上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure your family's onboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我撞到这位女士前 我爸刚进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad ran in right before I bumped into this lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.24,0:14:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让他登机 但要确保他找到家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Board him. Make sure he locates his family before you leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.27,0:14:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.31,0:14:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到你家人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 去找个空位坐 圣诞快乐 - 也祝福你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Find an empty seat. Merry Christmas. - You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,飞机即将起飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In order to push back from the gate...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请各位系好安全带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...all passengers must have their seat belts fastened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你去过佛罗里达吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So have you ever been to Florida?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,[法语]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎搭乘美国航空 第176班机直飞纽约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome aboard American Airlines flight 176 non-stop to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:50.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,差点以为赶不上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think we'd make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.51,0:15:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什么不对劲吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亲爱的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:15:59.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有那种感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们忘了什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We forgot something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.11,0:16:05.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 我想我们没忘什么 但我...只是有那种感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't think we did, but I just have that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是惨痛的回忆罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just bad memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们该做的都做了 该带的也带了 大家都到齐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did everything, brought everything. We have everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:14.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有什么好担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:21.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 是 你说的对 你说的对 一切顺利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, you're right. You're right. We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么好担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.27,0:16:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,法兰克叔叔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.91,0:16:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,巴斯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全部人都下机了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the last ones off the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们去了哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(迈阿密国际机场)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.48,0:17:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这是谁的? - 是布克的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoes's this? - It's Brooke's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:19.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是米根的? 把这给布克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this Megan's? Give this to Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.59,0:17:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这是凯文的 - 把这个...把这给凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This to Kevin. - Give this... Give this to Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 把这给凯文 - 把这给凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give this to Kevin. - Give this to Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.45,0:17:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 凯文 - 把这给凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kevin. - Give this to Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 把这给凯文 - 把这给凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give this to Kevin. - Give this to Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.31,0:17:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 把这给凯文 - 把这给凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give this to Kevin. - Give this to Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:34.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 把这给凯文 - 凯文 是你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give this to Kevin. - Here you go, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 凯文不在这儿 - 凯文不在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kevin's not here. - Kevin's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.93,0:17:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 凯文不在这儿 - 凯文不在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kevin's not here. - Kevin's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 凯文不在这儿 - 凯文不在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kevin's not here. - Kevin's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.33,0:17:52.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 凯文不在这儿 - 凯文不在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kevin's not here. - Kevin's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.29,0:17:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文不在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文不在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.53,0:17:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.18,0:18:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 我有紧急事件!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, this is an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.15,0:18:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里是什么城市?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What city is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是纽约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天 我又出事了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yikes, I did it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什么事呢 先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something wrong, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.82,0:18:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.73,0:19:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的家人在佛罗里达 而我在纽约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. My family's in Florida and I'm in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的家人在佛罗里达?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family's in Florida?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.03,0:19:18.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而我在...纽约?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in...New York?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.21,0:21:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(机场保安室)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.74,0:21:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孩子叫什么名字?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the child's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.47,0:21:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin. K-E-V-I-N
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们最后什么时候见过他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did you see him last?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在登机舱门边?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Curbside check-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 我在大门见过他 他跟着我们跑过通道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I saw him at the door. He was with us in the terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,许多人在保安检查时失散 每个人都通过保安吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most people get separated at security. Did everyone get through security?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.22,0:21:24.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不清楚 彼得...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Peter...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们那时很赶时间 我们一直跑到登机闸口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were in a hurry. We ran all the way to the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.79,0:21:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们什么时候发现不见他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did you notice he was missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当我们在提取行李时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we picked up our baggage here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.99,0:21:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这孩子试过离家出走吗? - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Has the boy ever run away from home? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.19,0:21:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他试过独自生活吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has he ever been in a situation on his own?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.00,0:21:49.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事实上 这种事以前发生过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact, this has happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快要变成麦家的旅行传统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's becoming a McCallister family travel tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.73,0:21:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好笑的是 我们从未不见行李{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funnily enough, we never lose our luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:13.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去年他意外地被留在家里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was left at home, by accident, last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.34,0:22:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是我太太所说家族传统的由来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what my wife meant calling it a McCallister family travel tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.87,0:22:24.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们会通知芝加哥注意此事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll call Chicago and...notify them of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他很有可能还在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The odds are that's where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他应该不会去了别的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very unlikely he'd be anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.85,0:22:49.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.52,0:22:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(新鲜海产)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的载货单呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, where's your manifest?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.36,0:23:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们到了 马夫 纽约都会 机会之都{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are, Marv, New York City. The land of opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.86,0:23:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,闻到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.90,0:23:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.93,0:23:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.60,0:23:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 鱼腥味? - 是自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fish. - It's freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 是鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No it's fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.47,0:23:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 是自由 和财富 - 好吧 好吧 是自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's freedom and it's money. - Okay, okay. It's freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧 不要被人发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go before someone sees us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.64,0:23:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是鱼腥味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.24,0:23:40.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我弄了两个假护照{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, one quick score.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以远走他乡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get ourselves some phony passports...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.58,0:23:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们拼命逃走到一些外国的国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and we hightail it to some foreign country.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到亚里桑那州?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arizona?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.78,0:23:55.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真聪明 马夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very smart, Marv.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.95,0:23:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你逃狱出来就只为了偷圣诞老人十几仙?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bust out of jail to rob 14 cents from a Santy Claus?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.42,0:24:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,聊胜于无{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every bit helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.92,0:24:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且我们可以有新外号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, now we got our new nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.12,0:24:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们叫"粘匪"!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the "Sticky Bandits"!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.02,0:24:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真可爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.99,0:24:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真可爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.93,0:24:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,广场酒店 纽约最好的酒店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The Plaza Hotel. New York's most exciting hotel experience. "
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.10,0:24:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,变态!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.79,0:25:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.76,0:25:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我好像看到谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought I saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.11,0:25:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,[法语]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.03,0:26:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找死! 走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serves you right! Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.00,0:26:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想她喜欢我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.38,0:26:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(广场酒店)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.44,0:26:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 请问大堂在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, where's the lobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.12,0:26:48.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 走廊尽头 转左 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Down the hall and to the left. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.80,0:27:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"叮当咚"节目的来宾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guests of the new Celebrity Ding-Dang-Dong...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.26,0:27:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,入住纽约最有名的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...stay at the world-renowned Plaza Hotel:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.10,0:27:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,广场酒店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New York's most exciting hotel experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.80,0:27:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,订房致电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For reservations, call toll-free...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.87,0:27:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,1-800-759-3000{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1-800-759-3000.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.27,0:27:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.14,0:27:33.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好 我是彼得·麦嘉利士打 我是家长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howdy-do. This is Peter McCallister. The father.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.61,0:27:35.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要订一间房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like a hotel room.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.81,0:27:41.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要有特大号床 电视 和可上锁的小冰箱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With an extra-large bed, a TV...and one of those little refrigerators with a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.34,0:27:44.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,信用卡? 没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Credit card? You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.98,0:27:50.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,广场酒店订房部 有什么可以帮你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plaza Reservations, may I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.41,0:27:53.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好 我是彼得·麦卡利斯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howdy-do. This is Peter McCallister.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.25,0:27:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是家长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The father.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.55,0:27:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 是的 先生 - 我要订一间房好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir. - I'd like a hotel room.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.98,0:28:00.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要有特大号床 电视{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With an extra-large bed, a TV...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.48,0:28:04.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和可上锁的小冰箱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and one of those little refrigerators with a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.98,0:28:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,入住登记时请出示信用卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll need a major credit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.32,0:28:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,信用卡? 没问题!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Credit card? You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.07,0:28:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢 希望令你宾至如归{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Enjoy your stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.36,0:28:19.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 八点两位 是山本先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, two at eight, Henri. Mr. Yamamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.46,0:28:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.36,0:28:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一会儿再打给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.93,0:28:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.60,0:28:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以为你服务吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.58,0:28:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦卡利斯特订的房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reservation for McCallister.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.87,0:28:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你自己住的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A reservation for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.30,0:28:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的双脚都快离地才够得到柜台{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My feet are hardly touching the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.57,0:28:48.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看我这么年少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can barely see over the counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.04,0:28:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我怎可以自己订房?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I make a reservation for a room?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.74,0:28:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你用脑想一想 我一个小孩来酒店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it: A kid going into a hotel making a reservation?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.57,0:28:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不认为是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.41,0:29:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是太明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.21,0:29:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我跟爸爸一起外出 他是来谈生意 正在开会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm traveling with my dad. He's on business. He's at a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.08,0:29:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我讨厌开会 况且我也不能参加会议 我只能坐在大堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate meetings. I'm not allowed to go in, only to sit in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.64,0:29:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,十分无聊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.08,0:29:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我爸爸叫我先来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So my dad dropped me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.85,0:29:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给我这张信用卡 他说负责登记的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gave me his credit card and said to have check-in...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.04,0:29:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会让我上酒店房间 那样我就不会受伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...let me in the room so I won't get into mischief.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.68,0:29:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有时我真的很容易受伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, sometimes I do get into mischief.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.12,0:29:26.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们全都是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.09,0:29:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.22,0:29:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有他的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.11,0:29:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有消息会通知你们 你们订了酒店吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll need to be in touch. You have hotel rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.72,0:29:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 订了 - 你们有他的近照吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Do you have a recent photo of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.09,0:29:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我钱夹里有一张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have one in my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.43,0:29:47.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,钱夹不在我这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.96,0:29:51.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的钱夹在背袋里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wallet's in my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.43,0:29:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文在机场找过我的袋 凯文带着我的钱夹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin was looking in my bag at the airport. He has my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.60,0:29:58.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 钱夹里有信用卡吗? - 信用卡 还有钱...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you have credit cards? - Credit cards, money...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.60,0:30:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们马上联络信用卡公司{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll notify the credit card companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.39,0:30:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假定你儿子拿着信用卡 只要他用的话便知道他在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If your son has the cards, we can get a location on him when he uses them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.00,0:30:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想凯文不懂用信用卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think he knows how to use a credit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.84,0:30:12.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.21,0:30:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 思治 - 是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cedric. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.23,0:30:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 不要在公共场所数你的小费 - 对不起!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't count your tips in public. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.98,0:30:26.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去查探一下那小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And find out everything you can about that young fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.28,0:30:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请到柜台!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Front, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.68,0:30:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎入住我们酒店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy your stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.88,0:30:39.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别忘了告诉你爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget to remind your dad, when he arrives...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.12,0:30:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等他来了让他来签个字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he must come down and sign a couple of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.22,0:30:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢 你非常帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, you've been helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.88,0:30:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以帮你拿吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I take your bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.25,0:30:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是这里 左边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up here to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.59,0:30:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胡佛曾经住过这层{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Herbert Hoover once stayed on this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.56,0:30:57.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是说清洁人员?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vacuum guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.12,0:31:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 是美国总统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.23,0:31:08.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是我们最好的套房之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is one of our finest suites, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.06,0:31:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,棒极了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.20,0:31:26.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一个人睡这么大的床!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! A huge bed just for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.44,0:31:36.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又豪华 又宽敞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luxurious and spacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.57,0:31:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好方便!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.44,0:31:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.05,0:31:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,钥匙要放在袋里 还是要自己拿着?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you want the key in the bag? Or did you want to hang on to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.98,0:31:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我自己拿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll hang on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.88,0:32:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一切满意吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.58,0:32:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 房间的温度适合吗? - 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is the temperature okay? - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.32,0:32:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你知道怎么用电视吗? - 我十岁了 电视是我的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you know how the TV works? - I'm 10 years old. TV's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.19,0:32:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.39,0:32:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.89,0:32:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不够的话 我还有很多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's plenty more where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.77,0:32:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我跳水会影响你们吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you mind if I worked on my cannonballs?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.07,0:32:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.91,0:33:00.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.12,0:33:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这才叫度假{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.49,0:33:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站在那里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.83,0:33:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我 庄尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.66,0:33:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道是你 你一出电梯我就闻到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it was you. I could smell you getting off the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.63,0:33:51.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,两球吗 先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two scoops, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.89,0:33:54.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,两球? 来三球吧 我不赶时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two? Make it three, I'm not driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.53,0:33:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 庄尼 你最爱的田园香味 - 谢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gardenias, Johnny, your favorite. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.93,0:34:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你昨晚也在这儿吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You was here last night too, wasn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.10,0:34:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我昨晚在蓝猴子演唱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was singing at the Blue Monkey last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.57,0:34:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她没有 她和你弟弟鬼混{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was not. She was smooching your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.40,0:34:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你昨晚在这儿和我兄弟鬼混{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You was here and you was smooching with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.27,0:34:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 看吧? - 根本不是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See? - That's a dirty lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.01,0:34:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不用解释 你跟每个人都有一手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't give me that. You been smooching everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.14,0:34:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,史纳菲 艾尔 里奥...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snuffy, Al, Leo...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.54,0:34:25.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以一直数下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could go on forever, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.64,0:34:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你完全误会我了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have me all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.51,0:34:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.68,0:34:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我相信你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.21,0:34:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我的机枪不信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my Tommy gun don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.05,0:34:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,庄尼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.88,0:34:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是我唯一的男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the only duck in my pond!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.95,0:34:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你跪下来 说你爱我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down on your knees and tell me you love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.85,0:34:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宝贝! 你是我的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby! I'm over the moon for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.78,0:34:44.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这样不够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta do better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.42,0:34:51.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如我对你的爱是海洋 没有飞机可以飞越这海洋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If my love was an ocean, Lindy'd have to take two planes to get across it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.85,0:34:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许我一时胡涂 但我相信你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I'm off my hinges, but I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.82,0:34:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我给你时间走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I'm letting you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.16,0:35:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会数到三{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna give you till the count of three,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.96,0:35:08.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给你这贱人滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get your lousy...lying...lowdown, four-flushing carcass out my door!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.13,0:35:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她的确是贱妇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's rat bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.33,0:35:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.38,0:35:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.75,0:35:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,三!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.81,0:35:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐! 畜牲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas, you filthy animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.94,0:35:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有 新年快乐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.95,0:36:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,房间服务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Housekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.07,0:36:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们识得有个型仔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know a guy who can do the cool jerk
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.60,0:36:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们识得有个型仔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know a guy who can do the cool jerk
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.54,0:36:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们说的那只猫是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This cat they're talkin ' about
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.84,0:37:02.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是最肥的一只猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder who could it be
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.71,0:37:05.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为我知道我是最重的猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I know I'm the heaviest cat
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.88,0:37:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你从没见过这样胖的猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heaviest cat you ever did see
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.04,0:37:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当他们看到我在街上走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they see me Walkin ' down the street
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.16,0:37:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有傻佬都鸭雀无声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of the fellas want to speak Hey, hey, hey
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.85,0:37:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们的脸上充满笑容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On their faces they wear a silly smirk 'Cause they know
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.02,0:37:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为他们知道我最棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the king of the cool jerks
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.12,0:37:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这偷窥狂快滚出去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here, you pervert, or I'll slap you silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.67,0:38:15.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们蜜月时也比这好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't look this bad on our honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,罗拔叔叔原来住在纽约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Rob lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.41,0:38:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如他们从巴黎回来 我便去拜访他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they're back from Paris, I'll drop in on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.72,0:38:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们常送很好的礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They usually give pretty good presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.71,0:39:41.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚安 妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.78,0:39:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚安 凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.39,0:40:17.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的内裤 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your drawers, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.32,0:40:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎可拿着这个到处走 这里可能有女孩在呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't flash these babies around here! There could be girls on this floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.36,0:40:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很小心的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was very careful, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.36,0:40:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿着内衣裤再小心也没用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't be too careful with underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.23,0:40:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.09,0:40:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 忘了你想要的小费{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. You wanted a tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.10,0:40:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不必了 昨天的还有剩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That won't be necessary, sir. I still have some tip left over.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.76,0:40:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要小费?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tip?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.30,0:40:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.83,0:40:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不 等等! 等等!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.14,0:40:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,招待会帮您叫的士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doorman will be happy to find you a taxi...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.70,0:40:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. McCallister.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.94,0:40:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.54,0:40:57.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.91,0:41:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今早的服务如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how are we this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.11,0:41:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 很好 我的车准备好了吗? - 就在大门 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fine. Is my transportation here? - Out in front, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.42,0:41:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,豪华轿车和...比萨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A limousine and a pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.11,0:41:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,广场酒店赠送的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compliments of the Plaza Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.34,0:41:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我希望你父亲明白 昨晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do hope your father understands that last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.61,0:41:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是去检查房间 以确定一切就绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I was simply checking to see that everything was in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.35,0:41:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他十分生气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he was pretty mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.28,0:41:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是很生气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.48,0:41:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他来纽约不是要来脱给人看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he didn't come here to have his naked rear spied on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.03,0:41:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然不是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.42,0:41:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他马上会下来吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will he be down soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.65,0:41:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他已经出去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.08,0:41:37.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想亲自向他道歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would've liked to have offered my personal apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.12,0:41:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如有人偷看你洗澡 你会想见他吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If a guy saw you in the shower, would you want to see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.09,0:41:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.89,0:41:44.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想你是不会再见到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you'll see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.83,0:41:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.49,0:41:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.33,0:41:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,希望你玩得高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a lovely day.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.07,0:42:05.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦卡利斯特!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McCallister...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.93,0:42:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(处理中)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.40,0:42:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 早安 麦先生 - 早安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning, Mr. McCallister. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.34,0:42:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦先生 你的...芝士比萨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. McCallister, here's your very own...cheese pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.22,0:42:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你好 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.66,0:42:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里有好的玩具城吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know any good toy stores?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.66,0:43:01.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.96,0:43:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(被偷)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.30,0:43:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,果然!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.94,0:43:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出去 滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get outta here! Go on get outta here! Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.24,0:43:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走开! 走开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beat it! Beat it! Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.74,0:43:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马夫! 过来! 我有话说!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Marv! Get over here! I gotta talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.58,0:43:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.55,0:44:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你要领巾吗? - 别理领巾吧 我们有事要谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would you like a scarf? - Forget about that, we gotta talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.38,0:44:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在我们没办法做大单的 像银行 珠宝店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have the equipment to pull off anything big: Banks, jewelry stores...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.29,0:44:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们不要货物 我们要现金 现在就要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't want goods. We need cash and we need it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.42,0:44:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,酒店可以吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about...hotels?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.39,0:44:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,游客常带着大量现金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tourists carry lots of cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.48,0:44:23.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有更好的主意 圣诞前夕商店的现金 不能存入银行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a better idea. Stores ain't depositing cash on Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.63,0:44:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,通常有大量现金的 都是卖中价货的店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stores that will have cash are the ones dealing in moderate priced goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.86,0:44:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.33,0:44:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么店圣诞前夕有大量现金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ergo, what store's gonna make the most cash on Christmas Eve...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.29,0:44:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而没有人会想到去抢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that nobody's gonna rob?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.00,0:44:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糖果店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Candy stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.36,0:44:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,九岁小孩才会抢糖果店 这是我选中的店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine-year-olds rob candy stores. This is what I had in mind:
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.98,0:44:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(邓肯玩具城)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.50,0:44:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真聪明! 真聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's brilliant, Harry! Brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.54,0:44:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有人会笨到 在圣诞前夕洗劫玩具城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's dumb enough to knock off a toy store on Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.47,0:44:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有的 就是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.48,0:45:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们到了 邓肯玩具城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are, sir: Duncan's Toy Chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.91,0:45:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐 凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.70,0:46:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是意外走失的意外收获{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the greatest accident of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.35,0:46:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(圣诞老人工作坊)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.87,0:46:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马夫 马夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marv. Marv!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.14,0:46:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好房子 但没有厕所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, nice house. But there's no bathroom in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.91,0:46:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的计划怎样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.28,0:46:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等大家都离去后 我们就从小屋走出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone leaves for a holiday off. We come out of our houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.45,0:46:44.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 然后呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.62,0:46:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们把收银机的钱全拿走 然后大摇大摆走出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We empty the registers and walk out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.28,0:46:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完美的计划!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great plan, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.92,0:46:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多谢 圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now, thank you and Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.95,0:46:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,代我向您家人问好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say hello to the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.79,0:47:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.32,0:47:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一个人来买东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shopping alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.12,0:47:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在纽约? 我想我是一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In New York? Sir, I'm afraid of my own shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.76,0:47:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我只想确认一下 - 您真负责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was just checking. - That's very responsible of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.03,0:47:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.73,0:47:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.40,0:47:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总共是23元75分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll be $23.75.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.57,0:47:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你为什么那么多钱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My, my, my. Where did you get all that money?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.77,0:47:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我有很多祖母 - 哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have a lot of grandmothers. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.40,0:47:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.10,0:47:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这间店真好 是我去过最好的玩具城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a nice store. One of the finer toy dealerships I've visited.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.67,0:47:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.94,0:47:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,邓肯先生一定是个很好的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Duncan must be a nice guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.07,0:47:43.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让所有的小朋友都能进来这里玩玩具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...letting kids come in here and play with his toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.41,0:47:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大部份玩具城都不这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most toy stores prohibit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.54,0:47:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 真的? - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that so? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.98,0:47:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他很喜欢小孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he loves kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.44,0:47:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事实上 今天所有收入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact, all the money the store takes in today...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.32,0:47:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,邓肯先生会捐给儿童医院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Duncan is donating to the Children's Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.21,0:47:59.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞节后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the day after Christmas...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.48,0:48:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们将收银机里钱取出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we empty out all the money in the cash register...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.95,0:48:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,邓肯先生会将钱送去医院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and Mr. Duncan takes it right down to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.45,0:48:07.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他真慷慨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's generous of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.95,0:48:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孩子们带给他许多快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, children bring him a lot of joy...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.52,0:48:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像带给所有重视孩子的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as they do to everyone who appreciates them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.52,0:48:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不该花这钱的 但我铲雪赚了二十元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not supposed to spend this, but I have $20 in a jar in our garage...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.72,0:48:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放在我哥哥也找不到的地方 我可以用那钱还给我妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where my brother can't find it. So I can pay my mother back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.73,0:48:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以请把这钱给邓肯先生 医院比我更需要它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So give this to Mr. Duncan. The hospital needs it more than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.13,0:48:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,况且我可能乱买糖果吃坏牙齿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, I'll probably spend it on stuff that will rot my teeth and mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.13,0:48:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那...那真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, that's... That's very sweet of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.70,0:48:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看到那边的树吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that tree there?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.00,0:48:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了感谢你的慷慨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, to show our appreciation for your generosity...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.94,0:48:54.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你可选一样东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'll let you select an object from that tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.80,0:48:58.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 带回家 - 免费的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...to take home with you. - For free?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.07,0:49:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我可以给你提议吗? - 可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- May I make a suggestion? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.24,0:49:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿那对斑鸠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the turtledoves.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.01,0:49:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以拿两个?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can have two?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.54,0:49:11.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 一对斑鸠 我再告诉你怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, "two turtledoves. " And I tell you what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.14,0:49:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你留一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep one...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.15,0:49:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,另一个送给很特别的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and give the other one to a very special person.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.55,0:49:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道 斑鸠是友情与爱的象徵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, turtledoves...are a symbol of friendship and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.25,0:49:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要两个人都有斑鸠 你们就永远是朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, as long as each of you have your turtledove...you'll be friends forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.79,0:49:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我从来都不知道 我以为它们只在歌里出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, I never knew that. I thought they were just part of a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.15,0:49:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错 而且它们也为此特殊理由存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are. And for that very special reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.99,0:49:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.36,0:49:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.59,0:49:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.06,0:49:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也祝你圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas to you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.29,0:49:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出去时穿多点 外面很冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be sure to bundle up if you go outside. It's nippy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.96,0:49:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.56,0:50:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(邓肯先生肖像)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.58,0:50:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.74,0:50:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说带我去中央公园动物园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised you'd take me to the Central Park Zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.02,0:50:44.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看那是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.25,0:50:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来 去捉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.39,0:50:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好 小朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.63,0:51:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.27,0:51:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.94,0:51:41.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小心点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, watch it, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.57,0:51:48.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快来买 不用跟人争 五元二串 五元二串{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buy now and avoid the Christmas rush. Two for $5. Two for $5.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.48,0:51:49.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,十元四串{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four for 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.34,0:51:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在那里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.04,0:51:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.11,0:51:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 谢谢 - 圣诞快乐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - Merry Christmas, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.69,0:52:34.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好极了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.46,0:52:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 谢谢你的提议 - 这是我的责任 荣幸之至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you for your suggestion. - My duty. My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.57,0:52:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救我! 有两个人在追我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! There's two guys after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.44,0:52:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事? 商店不收你偷来的信用卡?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? Store wouldn't take your...stolen credit card?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.47,0:53:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们让警察来处理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what the police have to say about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.21,0:53:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,起来! 起来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.28,0:53:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快 去捉他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Let's go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.01,0:53:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回来 你这小偷!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back here, you little thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.58,0:53:22.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,捉住那小孩!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop that child!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.55,0:53:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,捉住他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab him!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.62,0:53:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这小贱人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You little sh...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.53,0:53:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我犯了信用卡欺罪诈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've committed credit card fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.96,0:53:50.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,叫警卫来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me security!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.16,0:53:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们要把犯人捉住!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to stop that delinquent!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.46,0:53:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧 思治!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come along, Cedric!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.64,0:54:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,度假完了 是时候回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had enough of this vacation. I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.21,0:54:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站在那里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.41,0:54:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是门房先生!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Concierge, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.45,0:54:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.41,0:54:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一出电梯我就闻到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could smell you getting off the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.25,0:54:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你昨晚也在这儿吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You was here last night too, wasn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.65,0:54:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.88,0:54:49.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.42,0:54:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你昨晚在这儿和我兄弟鬼混{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You was here and you was smooching with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.42,0:54:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我恐怕您误会了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're mistaken, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.82,0:55:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不用解释 你跟每个人都有一手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't give me that. You've smooched everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.99,0:55:05.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,史纳菲 艾尔 里奥...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snuffy, Al, Leo...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.24,0:55:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有基夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Cliff...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.58,0:55:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(基夫)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.99,0:55:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.53,0:55:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说谎!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.26,0:55:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以一直数下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could go on forever, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.13,0:55:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我实在抱歉 先生 但恐怕您真的弄错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm terribly sorry, sir. I'm afraid you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.23,0:55:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们在找一个小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're looking for a young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.17,0:55:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 我相信你 但我的机关枪不信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I believe you...but my Tommy gun don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.90,0:55:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你跪下来说你爱我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down on your knees and tell me you love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.81,0:55:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跪下?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.04,0:55:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爱你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.68,0:55:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样不够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta do better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.11,0:56:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爱你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.98,0:56:06.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许我一时胡涂 但我相信你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I'm off my hinges...but I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.32,0:56:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我给你时间走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I'm gonna let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.65,0:56:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会数到三 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna give you till the count of three...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.03,0:56:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给你这贱人滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get your lousy, lying, low-down...four-flushing carcass out my door!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.86,0:56:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 一! - 打开门!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One! - Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.36,0:56:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.90,0:56:39.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,三!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.70,0:56:42.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐! 畜牲!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas, you filthy animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.27,0:56:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有 新年快乐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a happy new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.39,0:56:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,留在你们房间! 紧急事故!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay in your rooms! This is an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.89,0:56:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有持枪的神经客在内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an insane guest with a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.70,0:57:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.44,0:57:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来这儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.30,0:57:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,迈阿密来回机票 怎么了? 搭错了飞机吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Round trip to Miami. What's the matter, get on the wrong plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.24,0:57:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来你不再需要这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't be needing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.24,0:57:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美国航空不一定飞到目的地 小兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}American don't fly to the promised land, little buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.27,0:57:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.38,0:57:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们坐了九个月监 以为我们是世上最倒霉的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We spent 9 months in jail thinking we had the worst luck in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.77,0:57:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.44,0:57:36.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们逃狱后过得很好 我们会过得更好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We busted out and we're doing fine. Even better...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.21,0:57:40.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为我们不再抢住宅 我们现在要抢玩具城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because we're not robbing houses, we're robbing toy stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.81,0:57:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今晚半夜我们去邓肯玩具城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At midnight tonight, we'll hit Duncan's Toy Chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.18,0:57:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,五层楼的现金任我们拿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five floors of cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.12,0:57:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们用假护照逃到巴西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then after that, we grab some phony passports and go to Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.98,0:57:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 闭嘴吧 - 他又不会跟别人说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want to shut up? - He's not gonna talk to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.02,0:57:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,除了跟鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except maybe a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.25,0:57:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或送葬队伍说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.55,0:58:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们到地铁处置他 我要杀了他才安心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go to the subway tunnel. I'll feel better once I get him on ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.69,0:58:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我袋里有枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.19,0:58:09.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你敢开口便包你脑袋开花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say anything and you'll be spitting gum out through your forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.67,0:58:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.47,0:58:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.24,0:58:38.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.20,0:58:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.77,0:58:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快去捉他 他跑进了公园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get him. He went in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.04,0:58:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing flirting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.69,0:59:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那边!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.46,0:59:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要 给他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't! Give it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.66,0:59:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 哈利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.09,0:59:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我捉到他了! - 我看看!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got him. - Let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.02,0:59:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是他 放他下来 不是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ain't him! Put him down. That ain't him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.16,0:59:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们有机会便应杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should've shot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.41,0:59:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我讨厌拖拖拉拉 又给那小贼逃掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate pulling a job, knowing that creep's loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.73,0:59:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他可以怎样? 小孩子是无助的 - 不是这个小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What can he do? Kids are helpless. - Not this kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.57,0:59:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但这次他没有满布机关的屋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this time he doesn't have a house full of dangerous goodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.10,1:00:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是一个人在公园里 公园对小孩子来说很可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in the park. He's alone. Kids are scared of the park.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.10,1:00:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 大人在这里也活不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Grown men come in the park and don't leave alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.13,1:00:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.41,1:00:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,祝你好运 小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, little fella.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.18,1:00:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.68,1:00:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈 你在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.56,1:00:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.29,1:00:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小声点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn that down!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.96,1:00:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 喂 - 麦女士在吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Kate McCallister.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.26,1:00:58.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我是 - 我们找到你的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is she. - We found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.03,1:01:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 天! - 怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.70,1:01:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他们知道凯文在哪儿 - 在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They know where Kevin is. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.90,1:01:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他在纽约市 - 他在纽约!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's in New York City. - New York!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.13,1:01:06.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New York?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.10,1:01:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.77,1:01:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他一定很怕 他不是搞事的人 - 什么 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's scared, he's not a troublemaker. - What? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.53,1:01:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽约的警察...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New York police officers...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.98,1:01:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请等一等 别收线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just second! Please hold on
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.54,1:01:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他用了你的信用卡 住进了广场酒店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used your credit card to check into the Plaza Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.30,1:01:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他现在还在那儿吗? - 他还在那儿吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do they still have him? - Do they have him?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.34,1:01:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 不 警察还在找他... - 该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, they're still looking. - Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.61,1:01:25.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 请尽快赶去纽约 - 我们搭下班飞机去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get to New York. - We're on the next flight out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.34,1:01:27.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢 我们去纽约!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. We're going to New York, move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.84,1:01:29.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.41,1:01:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当酒店质问他信用卡时 他逃跑了 他一定很害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ran away when they asked about the card. He must be scared!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.78,1:01:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我想他不会去找我弟弟吧? - 他们不是在巴黎吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would he go to my brother's? - Aren't they in Paris?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.14,1:01:41.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 也许有人帮他们看屋 - 你不是说他们房子在装修{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe they have a housesitter. - Aren't they renovating?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.56,1:02:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.05,1:02:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,罗拔叔叔! 佐捷婶婶! 有人在家吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Rob! Aunt Georgette! Anybody home?!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.73,1:02:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.30,1:02:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人在家吗? 是我... 你们最疼爱的侄子 凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody home? It's me, your favorite nephew, Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.57,1:02:43.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,罗拔叔叔! 佐捷婶婶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Rob! Aunt Georgette!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.59,1:03:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小鬼 小心点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it, kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.19,1:03:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想听床边故事吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You looking for someone to read you a bedtime story?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.43,1:03:42.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,的士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.74,1:03:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,外面世界真可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's scary out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.67,1:04:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里面也不怎样好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't much better in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.72,1:04:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我再也不要这种度假{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't ever want to take a vacation like this again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.46,1:05:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们从哪儿走出来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.10,1:05:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道够不够你们吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have enough for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.20,1:05:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们很饿吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How hungry are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.10,1:05:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们把我的食物都吃光了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys ate all my food.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.49,1:06:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 我对着你尖叫 你刚才只是想帮我 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I screamed in your face. You were trying to help me, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.90,1:06:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Kevin McCallister.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.60,1:06:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的鸟儿很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your birds are real nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.40,1:06:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我见过你 你全身都是白鸽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen you before. You had pigeons all over you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.33,1:06:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第一次看到你 我觉得很恐怖 但仔细想想 也没什么可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At first, you look scary, but when I think about it, it's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.93,1:06:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定是鸽子喜欢你 才会跟着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must like you to be all over you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.20,1:06:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如我打扰你 我会离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'm bothering you, I can leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.84,1:06:42.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有否打扰你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.74,1:06:45.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.97,1:06:49.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 是不是很麻烦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. I'm not a pain in the butt?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.00,1:06:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.71,1:07:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,白鸽会自己飞回来 还是要你叫它们回来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will the pigeons come back on their own or do you call them?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.32,1:07:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把手给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.69,1:07:18.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们可以听到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.60,1:07:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太棒了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is great!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.13,1:07:42.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,外面很冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pretty cold out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.83,1:07:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想喝杯热朱古力 你要吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd sure like a cup of hot chocolate. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.70,1:07:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我请客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My treat.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.50,1:07:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不喜欢在冷清的公园过圣诞前夕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd hate to spend Christmas Eve in such a park.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.41,1:07:57.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以去温暖点的地方吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we go someplace warm?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.04,1:07:59.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.20,1:08:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道一个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know a place.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.63,1:08:50.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这音乐真动听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice music.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.96,1:08:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这地方真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is great.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.43,1:08:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在这里听过许多世界名曲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard the world's great music from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.93,1:09:12.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有带朋友上来吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you bring your friends here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.97,1:09:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的朋友不多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't got many friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.57,1:09:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.57,1:09:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我喜欢鸟儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm like the birds I care for.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.67,1:09:25.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人们在街上与我擦肩而过 他们经过我但没看到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People pass me in the street. They see me but they try to ignore me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.04,1:09:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们不当我是都市的一份子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They prefer I wasn't in their city.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.64,1:09:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 跟我的家人一样 我就像家里被忽视的白鸽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It's like that with my family. I'm like the pigeon of the house...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.79,1:09:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只因为我是最小的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...just because I'm the youngest.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.25,1:09:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每个人都在争斗 都希望名成利就{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone fights for position. Everyone wants to be seen...and heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.12,1:09:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我猜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.45,1:09:48.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说太多搞太多 所以常给罚回房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm seen and heard pretty much. But I get sent to my room a lot too.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.01,1:09:53.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我以前不是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't always like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.65,1:09:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你以前是怎么样的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you like before?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.36,1:09:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有工作 我有家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a job. I had a home.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.56,1:10:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 还有家人 - 你有孩子吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I had a family. - Any kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.29,1:10:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有 我曾经很想有孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I wanted them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.69,1:10:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我的爱人不再爱我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the man I loved fell out of love with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.13,1:10:14.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的心被伤透{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That broke my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.23,1:10:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每当我有机会再被爱时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the chance to be loved came along again...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.80,1:10:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我总是逃避{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I ran away from it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.36,1:10:22.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我无法再信任别人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stopped trusting people.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.70,1:10:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恕我直言 但那样做似乎很笨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No offense, but that seems like sort of a dumb thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.97,1:10:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我害怕再次受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was afraid of getting my heart broken again.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.34,1:10:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有时候你很信任一个人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes you can trust a person...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.00,1:10:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但一阵子他们便忘了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and then, when things are down, they forget about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.74,1:10:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许他们只是太忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they're just too busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.77,1:10:43.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许他们没有忘记你 只是忘了去想起你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they don't forget about you, but they forget to remember you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.74,1:10:49.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人不会故意去忘记 我爷爷说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People don't mean to forget. My grandfather says...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.03,1:10:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要不是我的头生在颈上 我可能会忘记在校车上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if my head wasn't screwed on, I'd leave it on the school bus.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.61,1:10:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是害怕 假如我真的相信某人 我会再次心碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just afraid if I do trust someone, I'll get my heart broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.78,1:10:57.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.28,1:11:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我以前有一双很美的溜冰鞋 我怕我会穿坏它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a nice pair of Rollerblades. I was afraid to wreck them...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.38,1:11:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以一直放在盒子里 你猜后来怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so I kept them in a box. Do you know what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.38,1:11:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我长大了再穿不下 我一次也没穿着出外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I outgrew them. I never wore them outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.01,1:11:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只在房间穿过两次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only in my room a few times.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.69,1:11:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人的心和感觉 和溜冰鞋是不一样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A person's heart and feelings are very different than skates.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.12,1:11:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,某方面都是一样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're kind of the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.42,1:11:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若你不再用心的话 心碎又有什么分别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you won't use your heart, who cares if it gets broken?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.05,1:11:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如只把心留给自己 也许会像我的溜冰鞋一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you just keep it to yourself, maybe it'll be like my Rollerblades.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.97,1:11:31.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当你想用它的时候 都已经不能用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you do decide to try it, it won't be any good.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.55,1:11:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你该利用机会 别再错过机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should take a chance. Got nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.98,1:11:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听起来颇有道理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little truth in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.99,1:11:42.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想是的 你的心也许受过伤 但还没死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think so. Your heart might still be broken, but it isn't gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.73,1:11:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如你的心已死 你不会还对人这么好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it was gone, you wouldn't be so nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.47,1:11:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.87,1:11:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道吗 我已经... 几年没和人说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know it's been...a couple of years since I've talked to anybody?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.21,1:11:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系 你说得不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's okay. You're good at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.37,1:12:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不会很无聊 不会喃喃自语和吐痰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not boring. You don't mumble or spit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.27,1:12:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你该多些交谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should do it more often.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.24,1:12:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想你该穿件没白鸽的衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wear an outfit with no pigeon poop on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.94,1:12:13.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是否令其他人远离我呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been working very hard at keeping people away.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.48,1:12:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我常常想假如我独自一人 一定很好玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always think I'll have a lot of fun if I'm alone...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.28,1:12:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但到真的独自一人时 却一点也不好玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but when I'm alone, it's not fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.18,1:12:21.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不在乎有时别人如何讨厌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care how much people bug me...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.98,1:12:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我宁愿有人和我一起 也不要自己一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'd rather be with someone than alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.52,1:12:29.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么你为什么一个人在圣诞前夕到处走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what are you doing alone on Christmas Eve?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.02,1:12:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你惹了麻烦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get into trouble?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.65,1:12:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.82,1:12:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你做错事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.55,1:12:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做错很多事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.39,1:12:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道以善抵恶吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know that a good deed erases a bad deed?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.32,1:12:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太迟了 我不知道是否有足够时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's late. I don't know if I'll have enough time...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.29,1:12:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去做好事来补偿我的过错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to do enough good deeds to erase all my bad ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.63,1:12:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在正是圣诞 今晚行善会有特别优惠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Christmas Eve. Good deeds count extra tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.13,1:12:55.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 真的? - 当然是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They do? - Of course they do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.03,1:12:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好好想一想 你可以帮别人做什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think of an important thing you can do for others...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.20,1:13:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且马上就去做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and go do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.17,1:13:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要依照你心中星星指引{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just follow the star in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.80,1:13:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.90,1:13:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,夜了 我要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting pretty late. I'd better get going.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.81,1:13:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如我没有再见到你 祝你一切顺利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't see you again, I hope everything turns out okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.51,1:13:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.54,1:13:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,替我向你的白鸽说再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell the birds I said goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.54,1:13:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.15,1:13:36.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.58,1:13:37.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.11,1:13:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如你需要找可以信任的人 你可以想到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you need somebody to trust, it can be me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.61,1:13:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不会忘记你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't forget to remember you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.55,1:13:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别许下无法实践的承诺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make promises you can't keep.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.10,1:14:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(圣安儿童医院)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.04,1:14:48.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,收银机里所有的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the money in the registers...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.14,1:14:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,邓肯先生将全部捐给儿童医院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Mr. Duncan is gonna donate to the Children's Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.24,1:14:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今晚午夜 我们会洗劫邓肯玩具城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At midnight tonight, we're hitting Duncan's Toy Chest.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.21,1:14:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们可以破坏任何事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can mess with a lot of things,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.63,1:15:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但绝不能在圣诞节欺侮小孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you can't mess with kids on Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.17,1:16:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(煤油)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.61,1:17:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们会为你提供一间免费套房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd like to offer you a complimentary suite.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.34,1:17:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是在面对公园的阁楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a penthouse with a view of the park.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.11,1:17:30.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想你们会感到满意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you'll find it satisfactory.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.44,1:17:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最近才由伯爵夫人空出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was recently vacated by a countess.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.24,1:17:36.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么酒店 居然会让一个小孩自己住宿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of hotel lets a child check in alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.38,1:17:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那孩子说的话跟真的一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boy had a very convincing story.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.95,1:17:41.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是什么白痴在这里工作?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of idiots work here?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.78,1:17:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是纽约最好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The finest in New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.52,1:17:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当你们发现信用卡报失...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you learned the credit card...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.32,1:17:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我发现的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made the discovery.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.45,1:17:51.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你为什么会让他走掉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you let him leave?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.72,1:17:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们正想问他时 他便逃走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We confronted him and he ran!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.02,1:17:55.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你把他吓跑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You scared him!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.35,1:17:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在是圣诞前夕 就因为你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Christmas Eve, and because of you,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.35,1:18:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的孩子在最大的城市走失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our child is lost in a huge city.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.72,1:18:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请带我们的家人和行李上房间去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take our family and luggage up to the room.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.29,1:18:07.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.56,1:18:09.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,手脚快点 思治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run along, Cedric.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.43,1:18:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我现在去警察局 确保他们尽全力找凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go to the police station to make sure they're looking for Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.09,1:18:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想你留在酒店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.09,1:18:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我要出去找他 - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm going to look for him. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.43,1:18:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不好意思 但令郎是在最大的城市走失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all due respect, your son is lost in one of the world's biggest cities.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.83,1:18:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请你别插嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you stay out of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.30,1:18:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,悉随尊便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.83,1:18:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢 我不认为你自己在纽约街头行走是好主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. It's not a good idea to run around New York City alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.80,1:18:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,既然我们的儿子可以 我也可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Kevin can, so can I.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.74,1:18:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 基蒂 - 我不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kate... - I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.04,1:18:39.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我认为现在不会有强盗或杀人犯敢来惹我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way I feel, no mugger or murderer would mess with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.58,1:18:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但外面有很多流泯...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are hundreds of armed parasites out there!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.57,1:18:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,穿多一点 外面非常冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do bundle up. It's awfully cold outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.92,1:19:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(邓肯玩具城)
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.43,1:19:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马夫! 马夫! 来 行动吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marv. Marv. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.29,1:19:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马夫? 动手橇吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marv. Crowbars up!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.77,1:19:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐 哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.55,1:20:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐 马夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy Hanukkah, Marv!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.08,1:20:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些钱多得数也数不完!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is more money than I can even count!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.18,1:20:21.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们以前为什么去偷住宅!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It makes you wonder why we spent so much time robbing homes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.58,1:20:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更不可思议的是 我们是逃犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The amazing thing is, we're fugitives from the law...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.12,1:20:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在竟置身于钞票堆里 而没人发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we're up to our elbows in cash and nobody even knows about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.12,1:20:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他回来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's back!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.99,1:20:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他拍了我们的照片!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took our picture!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.43,1:20:52.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的头发好看吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was my hair?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.93,1:21:02.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 不可以回头了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it. No turning back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.14,1:21:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又一次圣诞大战开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another Christmas in the trenches.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.27,1:21:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.47,1:21:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到此为止! 拿钱走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it! Get the money! Get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.65,1:21:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要杀了那小鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.51,1:21:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 马夫! - 我来了 哈利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Marv! - I'm coming, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.75,1:21:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈利?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.88,1:21:44.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.72,1:21:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真厉害!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.81,1:21:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我扭到了脚! - 他在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I twisted my ankle. - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.59,1:21:54.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 两位! 笑一笑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys! Smile!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.49,1:21:58.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.22,1:22:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我来扶你 - 我来扶你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help me. - I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.94,1:22:31.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,的士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.87,1:22:38.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,时代广场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Times Square!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.28,1:23:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他去了哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.78,1:23:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在上面 上来捉我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm up here! Come get me!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.02,1:23:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们杀上去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's kill!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.28,1:23:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, pea-brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.02,1:23:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们上次低估他 所以被捕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got busted because we underestimated that bundle of misery.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.22,1:23:15.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今时不同往日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ain't like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.68,1:23:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不是他家 他已经被吓坏了 他不会有什么计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ain't his house. The kid's running scared. He ain't got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.69,1:23:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我先想一想 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I do the thinking, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.52,1:23:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.02,1:23:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonny!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.22,1:23:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.76,1:23:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道我现在最想就是杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing would thrill me more greatly than to shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.93,1:23:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杀一个小孩 对我来说没多大意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knocking off a youngster won't mean that much to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.30,1:23:39.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 明白吗? - 恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Understand? - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.16,1:23:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我们在赶时间 我们来谈个交易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But since we're in a hurry, I'll make a deal with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.06,1:23:47.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你把相机抛下来 我们就不伤害你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You throw down your camera and we won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.77,1:23:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们从此消声匿迹 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never hear from us again. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.87,1:23:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你保证?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promise?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.74,1:23:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我对天发誓 否则不得好死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cross my heart and hope to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.00,1:24:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.04,1:24:07.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, kid...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.84,1:24:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把它给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.48,1:24:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正中目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.75,1:24:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里有几只手指?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many fingers am I holding up?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.39,1:24:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,八只?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.05,1:24:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小鬼 你掷砖头? 来吧! 再掷一个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, kid. You want to throw bricks? Go ahead, throw another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.42,1:24:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.62,1:24:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如你没别的花样 你死定了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can't do any better than that, you're going to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.63,1:24:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈利...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.59,1:24:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.00,1:25:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有砖头吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got any more?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.60,1:25:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,起来! 他没砖头了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up. He don't have any more bricks.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.20,1:25:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.20,1:25:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.76,1:25:20.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.84,1:25:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是你逼我的! 没有人向我掷砖块后 还逃得掉的! 起来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That did it! Nobody throws bricks at me and gets away with it. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.91,1:25:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你走这边 我去后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go this way. I'll go around back.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.51,1:25:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈利?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.58,1:25:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.18,1:25:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.89,1:26:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.07,1:28:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.77,1:28:10.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我到楼上了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I reached the top!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.03,1:29:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你最好还有新花样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better do better than this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.11,1:29:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.84,1:29:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好大个洞!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a hole!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.15,1:33:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈利?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.59,1:34:05.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我上来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming up!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.13,1:34:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要杀了那小鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna murder that kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.40,1:34:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好极了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.12,1:35:15.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道一个小孩一定胜过两个白痴吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know a kid always wins against two idiots?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.19,1:35:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈利? 他在客厅!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry! In the living room!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.06,1:35:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他上了爬梯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went up the ladder!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.23,1:35:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来了 哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.76,1:35:42.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.13,1:35:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.37,1:35:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的牙齿没崩! 来吧 他上了二楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't lose any teeth! Come on, he went to the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.70,1:35:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.83,1:35:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们为什么不试试楼梯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.00,1:36:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.37,1:36:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.54,1:36:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不记得去年怎么了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember last year?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.21,1:36:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.61,1:36:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.91,1:36:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去捉他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.94,1:36:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他打中我的嘴 马夫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He busted me right in my mouth, Marv!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.48,1:36:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's one.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.28,1:36:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别担心 哈利...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.01,1:36:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我去捉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.55,1:36:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正中我的要害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right in the schnoz.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.69,1:36:39.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第二个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's two.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.12,1:36:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧 我们去捉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.66,1:36:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哎呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oops.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.46,1:36:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.96,1:36:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第三个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...three.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.10,1:37:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.43,1:37:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第四个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's four.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.30,1:37:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 来吧 哈利 - 马夫 这个真的安全吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Harry. - Marv, are you sure this is safe?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.05,1:37:18.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已经试过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've worked all the kinks out.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.07,1:37:20.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如岩石一样稳固{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Solid as a rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.64,1:37:39.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像岩石一样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a rock, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.11,1:37:41.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们要不要放弃?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give up?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.35,1:37:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 痛得还不够么? - 绝不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you had enough pain? - Never!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.89,1:37:58.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你最好赶快祈祷!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better say every prayer you ever heard!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.85,1:38:01.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我希望你父母圣诞节能找到坟墓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope your parents got you a tombstone for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.22,1:38:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他去了哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.79,1:38:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在上面 好害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm up here and I'm really scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.33,1:38:20.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么声音?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.04,1:38:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是工具柜...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the sound of a tool chest...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.77,1:38:45.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掉下楼梯的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}falling down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.21,1:38:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好极了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.76,1:39:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.49,1:39:32.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算要坐电椅 我也要杀了那小鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if I get the chair, I'm killing that kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.09,1:39:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,投降吧 小鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surrender, kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.30,1:39:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He vanished.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.33,1:39:40.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在下面 你两个大笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here, you horse's ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.20,1:39:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.30,1:39:46.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恭喜你的颈受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice night for a neck injury!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.53,1:39:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接砖吧 小鬼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suck brick, kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.90,1:39:58.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧 马夫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Marv.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.24,1:40:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.40,1:40:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.90,1:40:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧 娘娘腔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you big sissy.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.15,1:40:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈利 你用了剃须水?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry? You wearing aftershave?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.05,1:40:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是火油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's kerosene.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.51,1:40:27.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,浸过火油绳子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rope is soaked in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.05,1:40:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么会都把绳子浸火油?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would anyone soak a rope in kerosene?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.55,1:40:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.79,1:40:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,返回上面!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go up!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.33,1:41:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,滚下来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.15,1:41:40.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿袋子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the bag!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.38,1:41:44.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抢劫邓肯玩具城的两个贼在公园里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two guys who robbed Duncan's Toy Chest are in the park.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.71,1:41:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中央公园西边 95街 留意放烟火的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Central Park West, 95th Street. Look for fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.31,1:41:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点 他们有枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, they got a gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.02,1:41:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.29,1:42:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最好在我报警前捉住我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better come and get me before I call the cops.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.36,1:42:18.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,风水轮流转呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My, how the tables have turned.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.39,1:42:19.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你喜欢冰吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you like the ice?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.56,1:42:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去公园走走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go for a little stroll in the park.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.74,1:42:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把那个背袋给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.97,1:42:48.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me it!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.34,1:42:55.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放到相簿应该很好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great for the album.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.48,1:43:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是赢了战斗 小鬼 但你却输了战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may've won the battle, dude, but you lost the war.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.01,1:43:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不该惹怒我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ought not of messed with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.41,1:43:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们是危险人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.88,1:43:12.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 哈利? - 闭嘴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Harry? - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.22,1:43:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈利?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.55,1:43:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,闭嘴! 我要好好享受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up! I want to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.79,1:43:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像有点问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.02,1:43:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们快离开这儿吧 - 闭嘴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's get out of here! - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.32,1:43:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没读过六年级...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never made it to the 6th grade...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.32,1:43:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来你也读不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and it doesn't look like you're gonna either.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.39,1:43:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让他走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.20,1:43:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文 快跑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.43,1:43:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,射她!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot her!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.03,1:43:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,射她!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot her!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.93,1:43:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 射她! - 我也想射她!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shoot her! - I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.05,1:44:27.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再见 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye! Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.82,1:44:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天 简直像国庆烟花!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, looks like the 4th of July!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.19,1:44:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去桥那边! 你们去隧道!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got the bridge. Take the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.33,1:45:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们走 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.63,1:45:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.87,1:45:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.37,1:45:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧 起身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.77,1:45:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,慢慢来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.21,1:45:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(坏人说要杀我)
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.14,1:45:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们该早点行动 监狱囚犯已交换圣诞礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys should've started earlier. The prisoners already exchanged gifts.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.18,1:45:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们错过了圣诞礼物?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We missed the presents?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.01,1:45:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是他要我一起藏在店里 去偷捐给小孩的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He made us hide in the store and steal the kiddies' charity money.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.85,1:45:41.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,闭嘴 马夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, Marv.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.61,1:45:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有沉默的权利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.11,1:45:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他脾气不太好 我们刚逃狱出来不久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a little cranky. We just broke out of prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.28,1:45:52.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住嘴 马夫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, Marv!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.25,1:45:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,带走他们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.22,1:45:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,记住假如上报的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this makes the papers...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.76,1:45:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们不再叫"水喉大盗" 我们是"粘匪"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we're no longer the Wet Bandits, we're the Sticky Bandits.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.43,1:46:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是"粘" NIAN...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's sticky. S...T... I. I.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.56,1:46:22.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,案件结束了 我们捉到窃贼也找回失款{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all over. We apprehended the thieves and got your money.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.67,1:46:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想尽快将钱送到儿童医院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to get that money over to the Children's Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.93,1:46:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我会帮您处理 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll handle it. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.47,1:46:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.03,1:46:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看这字条 好像是小孩打破窗口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found this note. Looks like a kid broke your window.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.30,1:46:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亲爱的邓肯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear Mr. Duncan:
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.84,1:46:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我打破你的窗口 是为了捉坏人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I broke your window to catch the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.39,1:46:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有买保险吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have insurance?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.64,1:46:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有的话 等我回到芝加哥 我寄钱给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If not, I'll send you some money, if I ever get home.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.26,1:46:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐 凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas. Kevin McCallister.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.64,1:46:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,附注: 谢谢你的斑鸠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}P. S. Thanks for the turtledoves.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.54,1:46:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斑鸠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turtledoves.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.88,1:47:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 我在找我儿子 就是这男孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. I'm looking for my son. This boy here.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.42,1:47:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托帮个忙 这男孩... 你见过他吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please help me. This boy right here. Have you seen him?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.49,1:47:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在找我儿子 他走失已两天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for my son. He's been missing for two days.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.15,1:47:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你报警了吗? - 当然有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you filed a report? - Of course we have.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.95,1:47:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么就相信我们 我们会处理的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then trust us. We'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.66,1:47:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我是他的母亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm his mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.36,1:47:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我了解 但你这样简直是大海捞针{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, but you're looking for a needle in a haystack.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.53,1:47:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有小孩吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.00,1:47:47.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.13,1:47:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你会怎么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if one was missing?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.43,1:47:54.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可能也会跟你现在一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd probably do the same thing you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.27,1:47:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.14,1:48:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站在你孩子的立场想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put yourself in his shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.34,1:48:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你会去哪儿? 做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where would you go? What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.47,1:48:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我? 我可能已死在某个水沟里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? I'd probably be lying dead in a gutter somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.34,1:48:10.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但凯文不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.01,1:48:14.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 凯文比我强壮勇敢得多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Kevin is so much stronger and braver than I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.82,1:48:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道凯文会很好 我肯定他很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know Kevin's fine. I'm sure he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.80,1:48:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但他仍是独自一人在纽约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's still alone in a big city.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.31,1:48:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他不该受这样的罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't deserve that.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.41,1:48:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他应该在家的 和自己的家人在一起 围着他的圣诞树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He deserves to be at home with his own family around his Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.48,1:48:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, dear God...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.78,1:48:38.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道他在哪里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.02,1:48:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我得赶到洛克菲勒中心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to get to Rockefeller Center.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.89,1:48:43.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 进来 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hop in. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.42,1:48:51.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道即使我做了好事 也不值得可以过圣诞节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I don't deserve a Christmas even if I did do a good deed.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.56,1:48:54.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不要任何礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want any presents.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.43,1:48:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,相反 我想收回曾对家人说过的尖酸话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead, I want to take back every mean thing I ever said to my family...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.63,1:49:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使他们不收回他们曾说过的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...even if they don't do the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.34,1:49:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不在乎 我爱全部的家人 包括巴斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care. I love all of them. Including Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.43,1:49:09.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如不能够再见到他们 我可不可以只见我妈?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can't see all of them, could I just see my mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.60,1:49:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一生以后什么也不要 我只要我妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never want another thing, ever. I just want my mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.20,1:49:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道今晚见不到她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it won't be tonight...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.03,1:49:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但答应让我再见到她 任何时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but promise me I can see her again. Sometime. Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.07,1:49:25.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使只有几分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if it's just once and only for a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.84,1:49:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只想跟她说对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to tell her I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.54,1:49:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.08,1:49:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.65,1:49:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,灵验得真快?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That worked fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.25,1:50:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.25,1:50:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.82,1:50:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也对不起你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry too.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.00,1:50:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐 妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.08,1:50:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.70,1:50:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.83,1:50:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.83,1:50:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎知道我在这里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you know I was here?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.43,1:50:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道你和圣诞树分不开 而这是最大的一棵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you and Christmas trees, and this is the biggest.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.50,1:50:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他家人在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.94,1:50:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在酒店 他们也不喜欢棕榄树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the hotel. They didn't like palm trees either.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.96,1:51:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下雪了 是早上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy smokes, it's morning!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.76,1:51:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是圣诞早上 各位!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Christmas morning, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.19,1:51:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别高兴太早{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get your hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.76,1:51:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.93,1:51:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞老人不会来酒店的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think Santa visits hotels.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.09,1:51:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞老人无所不在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you nuts? He's omnipresent.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.50,1:51:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他哪里都能去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He goes everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.83,1:51:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家快起床 圣诞节到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, it's Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.20,1:51:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈! 爸! 圣诞节了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Dad! It's Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.64,1:52:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它从何而来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd it come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.44,1:52:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈 爸 快来看这个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Dad! You gotta see this!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.71,1:52:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我的天! - 彼得!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My gosh! - Peter!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.01,1:52:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们没走错房间吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we in the right room?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.51,1:52:27.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别拆我的礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't open any of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.55,1:52:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 谁是邓肯先生? - 邓肯? 我不知道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's Mr. Duncan? - Duncan? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.78,1:52:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位 安静一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.45,1:52:35.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冷静!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.35,1:52:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧! 现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Now...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.42,1:52:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假如凯文一开始没惹事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if Kevin hadn't screwed up in the first place, again...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.69,1:52:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我们便不会住在这么大的酒店房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we wouldn't be in this most perfect...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.59,1:52:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有这么多的免费礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and huge hotel room with all this free stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.09,1:52:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.26,1:52:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应由凯文开第一份礼物才公平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I think it only fair that Kevin get to open the first gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.16,1:52:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后我再开 接着轮到大家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll go and the rest of you and so on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.46,1:53:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐 凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas, Kev.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.83,1:53:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐 巴斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.93,1:53:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐 凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.90,1:53:13.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啦! 圣诞快乐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.27,1:53:18.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感动时间够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough gooey sh...Show of emotion.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.75,1:53:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位 拆礼物了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.67,1:53:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家等一等! 把包装纸留下 留着明年可以再用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, save the paper. We can use it next year. And the bows.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.75,1:54:04.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.79,1:54:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.99,1:54:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.49,1:54:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有东西要给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.36,1:54:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.00,1:54:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是斑鸠 我一个 你一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a turtledove. I have one. You have one.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.00,1:54:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要我们各有一个 我们就永远是朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as we each have a turtledove, we'll be friends forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.77,1:54:35.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.10,1:54:39.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.00,1:54:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不会忘记你的 相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't forget you. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.75,1:55:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦先生的住房帐单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The room service bill, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.08,1:55:17.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.02,1:55:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是没得说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice family.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.56,1:55:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.02,1:55:39.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好个圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.48,1:55:41.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Davis
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.42,1:55:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凯文!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.54,1:55:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你居然花了967元叫房间服务?!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You spent $967 on room service?!
